    "body": "Spec'ing Chrome's behavior is probably most sensible in this scenario. `slotchange` most definitely need to fire on slotB, slotA2, slotA1 in this example since the slot's assigned nodes are mutated by the virtue of those nodes being manually assigned to another slot whether they belong to the same shadow tree or not.\r\n\r\nSince determining the order of each slot across different shadow trees is going to be rather expensive, we don't want to schedule slotchange events in the tree order either.",
