    "body": "On the other hand, it's rather odd that slotchange event will be fired in the tree oder if other slots belong to the same tree but they're enqueued in the order they were affected if they belong to different shadow trees. So I suggest we change that to always in the order they're affected. This will avoid unnecessary tree walking to sort slots.",
