    "updated_at": "2022-08-11T09:46:52Z",
    "body": "> Why the latter example is surprising? Assuming you get slotchange event with manual slot assignment at all, don't you want to get it for all the cases.\r\n\r\nIt's surprising because `slot.assignedNodes()` don't change in those cases. With named slot API, we only get a slotchange event when the contents of `slot.assignedNodes()` change.",
